                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't let the highly rated reviews fool you, this is one of the worst Steam games I've personally bought and played in years (as of writing this I'm closing in on 4000 games in my Steam library).\n\nThis is an extremely amateurish and poorly designed and coded game. The UI is a mess, movement is confusing and disorienting, game waves don't make real sense, enemies are just frantically crashing into everything (they are really stupid) and art direction is clashing hard with the background which makes the experience so much worse. In just a wave or two you can purchase the best upgrades which makes any other upgrades pointless and totally irrelevant. \n\nTLDR: This game is so bad that I wouldn't even bother to play it for free. There are tons of free SHMUPS made in flash that are superior in every single way to this.",
